      "id": "GO:0006679",
      "name": "glucosylceramide biosynthetic process",
      "aspect": "biological_process",
      "isObsolete": false,
      "definition": {
        "text": "The chemical reactions and pathways resulting in the formation of glucosylceramides, any compound composed of a ceramide backbone covalently linked to a glucose. The glucose can be further elongated with the sequential addition of various carbohydrate units.",
